        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 1440,
        "h": 800
      },
      "html": "<style>\n    @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Manrope:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,600;1,600&display=swap');\n@import url('https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/tabler-icons-webfont@3.35.0/dist/tabler-icons.min.css');\n</style>\n<main class=\"min-h-screen overflow-hidden bg-[#0f172a] font-[Manrope] text-[#fff7fb] selection:bg-[#f9a8d4] selection:text-[#172033]\" data-kid=\"1\" data-name=\"page layout container\">\n    <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_14%_8%,rgba(56,189,248,.20),transparent_28%),radial-gradient(circle_at_88%_12%,rgba(249,168,212,.15),transparent_26%),radial-gradient(circle_at_48%_100%,rgba(79,70,229,.18),transparent_40%)]\" data-kid=\"1-1\" data-name=\"background decorative gradient\">\n    </div>\n    <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 opacity-[.13] [background-image:linear-gradient(rgba(125,211,252,.25)_1px,transparent_1px),linear-gradient(90deg,rgba(125,211,252,.25)_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:44px_44px]\" data-kid=\"1-2\" data-name=\"background pattern grid\">\n    </div>\n    <header class=\"relative z-10 mx-auto flex w-[min(1248px,calc(100%-48px))] items-center justify-between border-b border-sky-200/20 py-5\" data-kid=\"1-3\" data-name=\"main header section\">\n        <a class=\"flex items-center gap-1 text-[22px] font-extrabold tracking-[-1.2px] text-[#fff7fb] no-underline\" data-kid=\"1-3-1\" data-name=\"brand logo link\" href=\"#\">\n            ar\n            <span class=\"font-[Playfair_Display] font-semibold italic text-[#a5b4fc]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-1\" data-name=\"brand logo italic accent\">\n                rai\n            </span>\n            .in\n            <b class=\"ml-1 text-[11px] text-[#f9a8d4]\" data-kid=\"1-3-1-2\" data-name=\"brand logo star icon\">\n                ✦\n            </b>\n        </a>\n        <nav aria-label=\"Signed-in navigation\" class=\"hidden items-center gap-1 rounded-full border border-slate-300/15 bg-slate-950/30 p-1.5 shadow-[0_10px_35px_rgba(2,6,23,.18)] backdrop-blur-xl lg:flex\" data-kid=\"1-3-2\" data-name=\"main navigation menu\">\n            <a class=\"rounded-full px-3 py-2 text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-300 no-underline\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1\" data-name=\"home navigation link\" href=\"#\">\n                Home\n            </a>\n            <a class=\"rounded-full px-3 py-2 text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-300 no-underline\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"community navigation link\" href=\"#\">\n                Community\n            </a>\n            <a class=\"rounded-full bg-sky-400/10 px-3 py-2 text-[11px] font-bold text-sky-300 no-underline\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-3\" data-name=\"ARRAI Pay navigation link\" href=\"#\">\n                ARRAI Pay\n            </a>\n            <a class=\"rounded-full px-3 py-2 text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-300 no-underline\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-4\" data-name=\"projects navigation link\" href=\"#\">\n                Projects\n            </a>\n        </nav>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-3-3\" data-name=\"header actions container\">\n            <a class=\"hidden items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-violet-300/30 bg-violet-400/10 px-3 py-2 text-[10px] font-extrabold tracking-[.04em] text-violet-100 no-underline sm:flex\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1\" data-name=\"wallet status indicator link\" href=\"#\">\n                <i class=\"ti ti-wallet text-sm text-[#a5b4fc]\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-1-1\" data-name=\"wallet icon\">\n                </i>\n                Wallet not active\n            </a>\n            <a class=\"flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-sky-300/25 bg-slate-950/30 py-1.5 pl-1.5 pr-3 text-[11px] font-bold text-[#fff7fb] no-underline\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-2\" data-name=\"user profile link\" href=\"#\">\n                <span class=\"grid h-7 w-7 place-items-center rounded-full bg-gradient-to-br from-sky-300 to-pink-300 text-[10px] font-extrabold text-slate-900\" data-kid=\"1-3-3-2-1\" data-name=\"user profile initials icon\">\n                    AR\n                </span>\n                My profile\n            </a>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n    <section class=\"relative z-10 mx-auto w-[min(1120px,calc(100%-48px))] pt-20 pb-16\" data-kid=\"1-4\" data-name=\"main content section\">\n        <div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[770px] text-center\" data-kid=\"1-4-1\" data-name=\"header content container\">\n            <p class=\"mb-5 font-[DM_Mono] text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[.16em] text-sky-300\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-1\" data-name=\"page section badge text\">\n                ARRAI PAY · SIGNED-IN ACCOUNT\n            </p>\n            <h1 class=\"m-0 text-balance text-[clamp(48px,6vw,82px)] font-extrabold leading-[.96] tracking-[-.075em] text-[#fff7fb]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2\" data-name=\"hero main headline\">\n                What are you\n                <br data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-1\" data-name=\"headline line break\"/>\n                <em class=\"font-[Playfair_Display] font-semibold text-[#f9a8d4]\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-2-2\" data-name=\"headline italic emphasis\">\n                    paying for?\n                </em>\n            </h1>\n            <p class=\"mx-auto mt-7 max-w-[590px] text-[15px] leading-7 text-slate-300\" data-kid=\"1-4-1-3\" data-name=\"hero description text\">\n                Pay ARRAI through Razorpay today. We confirm eligible payments after server-side verification—your payment does not add money to an ARRAI Wallet.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mt-14 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-[1.16fr_.84fr]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2\" data-name=\"pricing cards container\">\n            <article class=\"relative overflow-hidden rounded-[26px] border border-sky-200/25 bg-gradient-to-br from-[#0b6cae] via-[#2859bd] to-[#6347d9] p-7 shadow-[0_28px_80px_rgba(2,6,23,.28)] sm:p-9\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1\" data-name=\"VIP membership pricing card\">\n                <div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"absolute -right-14 -top-20 h-60 w-60 rounded-full bg-pink-200/20 blur-2xl\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"pricing card decorative blur\">\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"relative flex h-full flex-col items-start\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-2\" data-name=\"VIP card content container\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-white/10 px-3 py-1.5 font-[DM_Mono] text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.1em] text-cyan-50\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"VIP availability badge\">\n                        <span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#bef264]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"availability status dot icon\">\n                        </span>\n                        Available now\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"mt-8 font-[DM_Mono] text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[.13em] text-cyan-100\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"VIP label text\">\n                        MEMBERSHIP\n                    </p>\n                    <h2 class=\"mt-2 text-[38px] font-extrabold leading-none tracking-[-.055em] text-white sm:text-[46px]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-2-3\" data-name=\"VIP price heading\">\n                        Gold VIP\n                        <span class=\"whitespace-nowrap\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-2-3-1\" data-name=\"VIP price span\">\n                            · ₹45\n                        </span>\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"mt-5 max-w-[430px] text-[14px] leading-6 text-blue-50\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-2-4\" data-name=\"VIP description text\">\n                        A fixed one-time payment for VIP profile themes and the Gold tick. Access is granted only after ARRAI verifies the Razorpay payment.\n                    </p>\n                    <div class=\"mt-auto flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 pt-10\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-2-5\" data-name=\"VIP pay actions container\">\n                        <button class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-6 rounded-xl bg-[#fff7fb] px-5 py-3.5 text-[12px] font-extrabold text-[#172033] shadow-[0_10px_24px_rgba(2,6,23,.20)]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-2-5-1\" data-name=\"pay VIP button\" type=\"button\">\n                            Pay ₹45 for Gold VIP\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-arrow-up-right text-base\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-2-5-1-1\" data-name=\"pay button arrow icon\">\n                            </i>\n                        </button>\n                        <span class=\"font-[DM_Mono] text-[10px] leading-4 text-blue-100\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-2-5-2\" data-name=\"pay disclaimer text\">\n                            Opens Razorpay checkout\n                            <br data-kid=\"1-4-2-1-2-5-2-1\" data-name=\"pay disclaimer line break\"/>\n                            then waits for verification\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </article>\n            <article class=\"rounded-[26px] border border-pink-200/25 bg-[#162238]/85 p-7 shadow-[0_22px_60px_rgba(2,6,23,.22)] backdrop-blur sm:p-8\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2\" data-name=\"flexible payment pricing card\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"flexible card header container\">\n                    <span class=\"grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-pink-300/15 text-xl text-[#f9a8d4]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"flexible card icon container\">\n                        <i class=\"ti ti-credit-card-pay\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"flexible payment icon\">\n                        </i>\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"rounded-full border border-sky-300/25 px-2.5 py-1 font-[DM_Mono] text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[.08em] text-sky-300\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"flexible availability badge\">\n                        Available now\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"mt-8 font-[DM_Mono] text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[.13em] text-sky-300\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-2\" data-name=\"flexible label text\">\n                    FLEXIBLE PAYMENT\n                </p>\n                <h2 class=\"mt-2 text-[30px] font-extrabold leading-[1.05] tracking-[-.05em]\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-3\" data-name=\"flexible card heading\">\n                    Pay ARRAI an amount\n                </h2>\n                <p class=\"mt-4 text-[13px] leading-6 text-slate-300\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-4\" data-name=\"flexible card description text\">\n                    For an agreed ARRAI payment. This checkout does not automatically fulfil a service, creator purchase, or wallet action.\n                </p>\n                <div aria-label=\"Suggested amounts\" class=\"mt-6 flex gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-5\" data-name=\"suggested amounts container\">\n                    <span class=\"rounded-lg border border-sky-300/30 bg-sky-300/10 px-3 py-2 text-[12px] font-bold text-sky-100\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-5-1\" data-name=\"amount 49 label\">\n                        ₹49\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-400/20 bg-slate-950/25 px-3 py-2 text-[12px] font-bold text-slate-200\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-5-2\" data-name=\"amount 99 label\">\n                        ₹99\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-400/20 bg-slate-950/25 px-3 py-2 text-[12px] font-bold text-slate-200\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-5-3\" data-name=\"amount 299 label\">\n                        ₹299\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n                <button class=\"mt-7 inline-flex w-full items-center justify-between rounded-xl border border-sky-300/60 bg-sky-400/10 px-4 py-3.5 text-[12px] font-extrabold text-sky-100\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-6\" data-name=\"open pay button\" type=\"button\">\n                    Choose amount & open Razorpay\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-arrow-up-right text-base\" data-kid=\"1-4-2-2-6-1\" data-name=\"open pay button icon\">\n                    </i>\n                </button>\n            </article>\n        </div>\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"account-snapshot\" class=\"mt-5 rounded-[24px] border border-slate-200/15 bg-[#111d33]/78 p-6 shadow-[0_18px_60px_rgba(2,6,23,.18)] sm:p-8\" data-kid=\"1-4-3\" data-name=\"account snapshot section\">\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col justify-between gap-6 md:flex-row md:items-start\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1\" data-name=\"snapshot header container\">\n                <div data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-1\" data-name=\"snapshot title group\">\n                    <p class=\"font-[DM_Mono] text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[.14em] text-[#a5b4fc]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"snapshot label text\">\n                        YOUR ARRAI PAY ACCOUNT\n                    </p>\n                    <h2 class=\"mt-2 text-[30px] font-extrabold tracking-[-.055em]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-1-2\" data-name=\"snapshot heading\" id=\"account-snapshot\">\n                        Account snapshot\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"mt-3 max-w-[560px] text-[13px] leading-6 text-slate-300\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-1-3\" data-name=\"snapshot description text\">\n                        ARRAI Wallet has not launched. There is no stored balance or wallet transaction ledger on this account yet.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <a class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 rounded-lg border border-slate-400/25 px-3.5 py-2.5 text-[11px] font-bold text-slate-200 no-underline\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-2\" data-name=\"roadmap link\" href=\"#roadmap\">\n                    See planned features\n                    <i class=\"ti ti-arrow-down text-sm\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1-2-1\" data-name=\"roadmap arrow icon\">\n                    </i>\n                </a>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-7 grid divide-y divide-slate-300/10 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/10 bg-slate-950/20 md:grid-cols-2 md:divide-x md:divide-y-0\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2\" data-name=\"snapshot details container\">\n                <div class=\"p-5\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-1\" data-name=\"wallet balance detail\">\n                    <p class=\"font-[DM_Mono] text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-slate-400\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-1-1\" data-name=\"balance label\">\n                        Wallet balance\n                    </p>\n                    <p class=\"mt-2 text-[20px] font-extrabold text-slate-100\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-1-2\" data-name=\"balance value\">\n                        Unavailable\n                    </p>\n                    <p class=\"mt-1 text-[12px] leading-5 text-slate-400\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-1-3\" data-name=\"balance description\">\n                        A balance will appear only after the wallet and ledger are live.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"p-5\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-2\" data-name=\"wallet history detail\">\n                    <p class=\"font-[DM_Mono] text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-slate-400\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"history label\">\n                        Wallet history\n                    </p>\n                    <p class=\"mt-2 text-[20px] font-extrabold text-slate-100\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"history value\">\n                        Not available yet\n                    </p>\n                    <p class=\"mt-1 text-[12px] leading-5 text-slate-400\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2-2-3\" data-name=\"history description\">\n                        Checkout verification is not a wallet transaction record.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"mt-5 flex gap-2 text-[12px] leading-5 text-[#f9c6df]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-3\" data-name=\"snapshot warning text\">\n                <i class=\"ti ti-info-circle mt-0.5 shrink-0 text-base text-[#f9a8d4]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-3-1\" data-name=\"info icon\">\n                </i>\n                Payments made here will not add money to a wallet, cannot be sent to another person, and cannot be used for bank transfer or recharge.\n            </p>\n        </section>\n        <section aria-labelledby=\"roadmap-title\" class=\"mt-16\" data-kid=\"1-4-4\" data-name=\"roadmap section\" id=\"roadmap\">\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col justify-between gap-5 sm:flex-row sm:items-end\" data-kid=\"1-4-4-1\" data-name=\"roadmap header container\">\n                <div data-kid=\"1-4-4-1-1\" data-name=\"roadmap title group\">\n                    <p class=\"font-[DM_Mono] text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[.14em] text-sky-300\" data-kid=\"1-4-4-1-1-1\" data-name=\"roadmap label text\">\n                        BUILDING RESPONSIBLY\n                    </p>\n                    <h2 class=\"mt-2 text-[clamp(32px,4vw,48px)] font-extrabold tracking-[-.06em]\" data-kid=\"1-4-4-1-1-2\" data-name=\"roadmap heading\" id=\"roadmap-title\">\n                        ARRAI Pay roadmap.\n                    </h2>\n                </div>\n                <p class=\"max-w-[320px] text-[12px] leading-5 text-slate-400\" data-kid=\"1-4-4-1-2\" data-name=\"roadmap description\">\n                    These are planned capabilities, not available actions. No launch date is announced.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"mt-7 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3\" data-kid=\"1-4-4-2\" data-name=\"roadmap items container\">\n                <article class=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/14 bg-slate-900/35 p-6\" data-kid=\"1-4-4-2-1\" data-name=\"roadmap store money item\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-start justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-4-4-2-1-1\" data-name=\"store money header\">\n                        <span class=\"grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-sky-300/10 text-xl text-sky-300\" data-kid=\"1-4-4-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"store money icon container\">\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-wallet\" data-kid=\"1-4-4-2-1-1-1-1\" data-name=\"store money icon\">\n                            </i>\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"font-[DM_Mono] text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[.1em] text-slate-400\" data-kid=\"1-4-4-2-1-1-2\" data-name=\"planned badge\">\n                            Planned\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"mt-7 font-[DM_Mono] text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-slate-400\" data-kid=\"1-4-4-2-1-2\" data-name=\"store money label\">\n                        STORE MONEY\n                    </p>\n                    <h3 class=\"mt-2 text-[24px] font-extrabold tracking-[-.045em]\" data-kid=\"1-4-4-2-1-3\" data-name=\"store money heading\">\n                        Add & spend across ARRAI\n                    </h3>\n                    <p class=\"mt-3 text-[13px] leading-6 text-slate-300\" data-kid=\"1-4-4-2-1-4\" data-name=\"store money description\">\n                        A stored-value wallet, secure ledger, and eligible site spending after the required systems are live.\n                    </p>\n                </article>\n                <article class=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/14 bg-slate-900/35 p-6\" data-kid=\"1-4-4-2-2\" data-name=\"roadmap pay someone item\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-start justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-4-4-2-2-1\" data-name=\"pay someone header\">\n                        <span class=\"grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-violet-300/10 text-xl text-[#a5b4fc]\" data-kid=\"1-4-4-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"pay someone icon container\">\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-building-bank\" data-kid=\"1-4-4-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"pay someone icon\">\n                            </i>\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"font-[DM_Mono] text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[.1em] text-slate-400\" data-kid=\"1-4-4-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"planned badge\">\n                            Planned\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"mt-7 font-[DM_Mono] text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-slate-400\" data-kid=\"1-4-4-2-2-2\" data-name=\"pay someone label\">\n                        PAY SOMEONE\n                    </p>\n                    <h3 class=\"mt-2 text-[24px] font-extrabold tracking-[-.045em]\" data-kid=\"1-4-4-2-2-3\" data-name=\"pay someone heading\">\n                        UPI scan-pay & bank transfer\n                    </h3>\n                    <p class=\"mt-3 text-[13px] leading-6 text-slate-300\" data-kid=\"1-4-4-2-2-4\" data-name=\"pay someone description\">\n                        Partner-supported transfers with the compliance and verification required before money can move to another person.\n                    </p>\n                </article>\n                <article class=\"rounded-2xl border border-slate-200/14 bg-slate-900/35 p-6\" data-kid=\"1-4-4-2-3\" data-name=\"roadmap pay bill item\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-start justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-4-4-2-3-1\" data-name=\"pay bill header\">\n                        <span class=\"grid h-10 w-10 place-items-center rounded-xl bg-pink-300/10 text-xl text-[#f9a8d4]\" data-kid=\"1-4-4-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"pay bill icon container\">\n                            <i class=\"ti ti-device-mobile\" data-kid=\"1-4-4-2-3-1-1-1\" data-name=\"pay bill icon\">\n                            </i>\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"font-[DM_Mono] text-[9px] uppercase tracking-[.1em] text-slate-400\" data-kid=\"1-4-4-2-3-1-2\" data-name=\"planned badge\">\n                            Planned\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"mt-7 font-[DM_Mono] text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-slate-400\" data-kid=\"1-4-4-2-3-2\" data-name=\"pay bill label\">\n                        PAY A BILL\n                    </p>\n                    <h3 class=\"mt-2 text-[24px] font-extrabold tracking-[-.045em]\" data-kid=\"1-4-4-2-3-3\" data-name=\"pay bill heading\">\n                        Mobile recharge\n                    </h3>\n                    <p class=\"mt-3 text-[13px] leading-6 text-slate-300\" data-kid=\"1-4-4-2-3-4\" data-name=\"pay bill description\">\n                        A supported recharge experience once a reliable operator and payment workflow is available.\n                    </p>\n                </article>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n        <div class=\"mt-16 flex flex-col justify-between gap-5 border-t border-sky-200/15 pt-7 text-[11px] text-slate-400 sm:flex-row sm:items-center\" data-kid=\"1-4-5\" data-name=\"footer disclaimer container\">\n            <p class=\"flex items-center gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-4-5-1\" data-name=\"security disclaimer text\">\n                <i class=\"ti ti-shield-check text-base text-[#bef264]\" data-kid=\"1-4-5-1-1\" data-name=\"security shield icon\">\n                </i>\n                Live checkout is processed by Razorpay. Eligible access changes only after verification.\n            </p>\n            <a class=\"font-bold text-sky-300 no-underline\" data-kid=\"1-4-5-2\" data-name=\"support link\" href=\"#\">\n                Payment support\n                <i class=\"ti ti-arrow-up-right\" data-kid=\"1-4-5-2-1\" data-name=\"support link icon\">\n                </i>\n            </a>\n        </div>\n    </section>\n    <footer class=\"relative z-10 border-t border-sky-200/15 bg-slate-950/20\" data-kid=\"1-5\" data-name=\"footer container\">\n        <div class=\"mx-auto flex w-[min(1248px,calc(100%-48px))] flex-col gap-4 py-8 text-[11px] text-slate-400 sm:flex-row sm:items-center sm:justify-between\" data-kid=\"1-5-1\" data-name=\"footer content wrapper\">\n            <a class=\"text-lg font-extrabold tracking-[-1px] text-slate-100 no-underline\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-1\" data-name=\"footer brand link\" href=\"#\">\n                ar\n                <span class=\"font-[Playfair_Display] italic text-[#a5b4fc]\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-1-1\" data-name=\"footer brand italic accent\">\n                    rai\n                </span>\n                .in\n            </a>\n            <p data-kid=\"1-5-1-2\" data-name=\"footer text\">\n                ARRAI Pay · Checkout available through Razorpay\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"flex gap-5\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-3\" data-name=\"footer utility links container\">\n                <a class=\"text-slate-300 no-underline\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-3-1\" data-name=\"privacy policy link\" href=\"#\">\n                    Privacy\n                </a>\n                <a class=\"text-slate-300 no-underline\" data-kid=\"1-5-1-3-2\" data-name=\"terms of service link\" href=\"#\">\n                    Terms\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </footer>\n</main>\n",
      "comments": [],
      "created": "2026-09-28T16:38:21.329305+00:00",
      "modified": "2026-09-28T16:39:13.277457+00:00",
